	"descriptionMarkdown": "Current Version: 0.3\n\nLast Update Date: 21-aug-2026\n\nThis set of blueprints are designed to help one conquer the warptorio2 modpack by Vecna. Note that at the time of upload, the modpack is in a constant state of updates and blueprint author does not guarantee returning to Vecna's iteration of the mod.\n\nThe goal of this blueprint book is to provide a basic level of design for the early game, possibly the mid-game. The goal is **not** hyper-optimized patterns as the author is limited in that capacity, but should seem to make reasonable space utilization and moderate automation where able.\n\nReading the blueprint book: All blueprints have 2 numbers, slot 1 is the floor level, with 0 being ground, 1 being factory floor, 2 being garden floor. Slot 2 is the iteration based on available space. All blueprints assume the teardown of the prior factory due to Vecna's heavier emphasis of spacial limitations (which makes straightforward upgrade-in-stages planning difficult as sushi belts are almost mandatory at some stages). **Always** be mindful of when you are upgrading, as the floor upgrades will remove items that are on the hazard concrete to place the upgrade(s). As of time of writing/updating, the water on the garden floor **will** also delete entities to restore the water.\n\nCurrent status:\n\n0-4 : researched, vB in progress, (with blue automation) not yet started\n\n1-3: research complete, no changes from 1-2.\n\n",
